Med:39048823). May be a tumor suppressor in brain cancers (PubMed:12743596)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}